# SyOS flatpak manifest - one application id per line, '#' starts a comment.
#
# Policy is apt-first (design doc 4.7); flatpak is the fallback for apps
# Debian does not ship or ships too old. Installed per-user from flathub.

# Notes. Debian packages no comparable markdown editor, and Obsidian is not
# distributed as a .deb at all. It is Electron and it is large, accepted
# because the requirement was real editing power - bold, colour, highlight,
# nested bullets - over plain markdown files that stay readable in nvim.
md.obsidian.Obsidian
